        "Discuss practices and system conditions rather than judging individuals."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": ["值得保留", "Keep"],
      "children": [
        {
          "title": ["哪些做法带来了帮助？", "Which practices helped?"],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "title": ["具体事例和影响", "Specific examples and impact"],
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": ["遇到的困难", "Difficulties"],
      "children": [
        {
          "title": ["原先预期与实际结果", "Expected versus actual outcome"],
