              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": ["背后的原因或假设", "Underlying causes or hypotheses"],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "title": ["如何验证原因？", "How can we verify the cause?"],
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": ["下一轮改进", "Next improvements"],
      "children": [
        {
          "title": ["只选一到两项", "Choose only one or two"],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "title": ["负责人和下次尝试时间", "Owner and next attempt"],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "title": ["用什么信号判断有效？", "What signal will show it helped?"],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "title": ["检查上次改进的结果", "Review the outcome of the previous improvement"],
          "children": []
        }
